<!DOCTYPE airframe SYSTEM "../airframe.dtd">
<airframe name="Manta">
  <description>
+ Airframe with the default FC-PNP set flightcontroller hardware
    + Model:       Original Fimi Manta
    + Autopilot:   Default PNP set is compatible Mateksys F405-TE SD
    + Actuators:   Default servos
    + GNSS         Default uBlox M10 GNSS
    + MAG          None
    + ESC:         Default PNP set
    + RCRX:        OpenRXSR
    + AIRSPEED:    None
    + TELEMETRY:   Hope SiK 868MHz
    + CURRENT:     Default ESC sensor
    + RANGER:      None
    + MOTOR:       Default 2x 2004 - 3000Kv
    + PROP:        Default Gemfan 6" x 2.6" two-blade

NOTES:
    WIP

    No IMU yet, no UART2 in YET

    For time being change in 
      sw/airborne/arch/chibios/STM32F405xG.ld

      -    flash0  : org = 0x08010000, len = 1M
      +    flash0  : org = 0x08004000, len = 1M

      If you change the boaerd.cfg do a make again to generate the new board.h

  </description>

